# EvidenceLoop Client Environment Configuration
# ---------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Local Development:
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api

# 2. Vercel Fullstack Deployment (Frontend + Serverless API on Vercel):
# Leave empty or set to /api (requests route automatically to /api on same domain)
# VITE_API_URL=/api

# 3. Decoupled Vercel (Frontend) + Render (Backend API):
# Set in Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables:
# VITE_API_URL=https://<your-render-backend-name>.onrender.com/api
